Validation / Acceptance Criteria:
Pass if, for each pin:
1) No timeout occurs while waiting for the interrupt;
2) After the falling edge, the per-pin input bit reads low;
3) INTR1_INTR_STS1 indicates only the current pin set;
4) After clearing, INTR1_INTR_STS1 reads zero; and
5) RAW_STCR1 successfully clears the system raw status; otherwise fail.

Pass if:
1) No timeout occurs while waiting for the interrupt per pin;
2) On entry to the interrupt handler, INTR1_INTR_STS1 indicates that an interrupt occurred;
3) After clearing per-pin raw status for all pins, INTR1_INTR_STS1 reads zero; and
4) RAW_STCR1 is written and verified cleared successfully; otherwise fail.
